## Spec B8 (docs/specs/stdlib/executor.spec.md): block_on drives a
## sub-phase-2B chained-await future to completion across multiple
## suspension points. The poll loop polls 3 times (Pending after
## state 0, Pending after state 1, Ready(30) from state 2).
async def inner_a() -> Int
  10
end

async def inner_b() -> Int
  20
end

async def outer() -> Int
  let a = inner_a().await
  let b = inner_b().await
  a + b
end

def main
  let result = block_on(outer())
  puts "#{result}"
end
